                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a6de95b-bbf3-3d15-b12d-1ad6f8acd234",
                        "entry_id": "68ffb9cf-1454-399f-bbf6-e0a36863b8a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Full of doubt; dubious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "daa20e8f-65ec-4981-9401-d54183a37476",
                                "sense_id": "7a6de95b-bbf3-3d15-b12d-1ad6f8acd234",
                                "text": "Indeed, had not I appeared to the world with all possible demonstrations of authority and truth, teaching men a most holy and undeniable doctrine, sufficient to reform their manners and amend their lives, and moreover demonstrating my divine commission, by such proofs as ought to satisfy and convince the most doubting and suspicious minds; they might have had some plea and excuse of ignorance for their unbelief;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c23284c9-9f39-4c9d-8b84-d8f3e53c13f0",
                                "sense_id": "7a6de95b-bbf3-3d15-b12d-1ad6f8acd234",
                                "text": "Had Keir been told two years ago that he would be involved in all these domesticities, he would have been more doubting than a doubting Thomas."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac97e404-51b8-43e3-a6cc-d206406c9a10",
                                "sense_id": "7a6de95b-bbf3-3d15-b12d-1ad6f8acd234",
                                "text": "Critics, as the name clearly suggests, are very doubting of brand and firm behaviour, yet they appear to be more focused on being critical than on actually acting on their opinions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "62c28eb2-47c8-3455-9a96-881f1a3e6642",
                "word": "doubting",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "9d621271-c319-4657-9a3e-66ea98dcb59f",
                        "entry_id": "62c28eb2-47c8-3455-9a96-881f1a3e6642",
                        "tags": [
